      <li id="src-3">Heinrich, B. (2000). <em>Mind of the Raven</em>. Harper Perennial. — inter-species play; raven behaviour at wolf kills.</li>
      <li id="src-4">Simek, R. (1993). <em>Dictionary of Northern Mythology</em> (trans. A. Hall). D. S. Brewer. — Geri, Freki, Huginn, Muninn — Odin's paired animals.</li>
    </ol>
